# Reference: solution-placed-entrypoints solution.
#
# The solution places the entrypoint shapes (and arm) itself,
# then carries spawned molecule onto the exit.
#
# This is solution.
# The level is defined in `examples/41_unfixed_delivery.oml`.

# Place the entrypoint shapes (the level runs unfixed).
place entrance_straight_2 2 3 rotation=1                 # ids 0, 1
place exit_straight_2 3 2 rotation=2                     # ids 2, 3

# Arm at (3,3); rotation 0 -> hand at (2,4).
place arm 3 3                                            # id 4

# Grab the molecule, moves it four steps onto the exit, then release.
action 4 1 grab
action 4 2 rotate_clw
action 4 3 rotate_clw
action 4 4 rotate_clw
action 4 5 rotate_clw
action 4 6 release
